# Clean URLs

- In-page links: path-relative, no `.html` (`href="about"`, home `href="./"`).
- Keep on-disk `*.html` files; do not strip asset extensions.
- SEO (when a production domain exists): absolute clean URLs only — never github.io, never `.html`.
- Client redirect: strip `.html` from pathname on http(s) only.
